- Log in to the system from the internet: accessing the system from outside the VUB-network
- Log in to the system via the VUB-network: accessing the system whilst using the VUB-Network
- Register for an account: requesting access to the system (become a Member)
- Log off: Log off the system
- Change password: A user who has forgotten his/her password, can request a new one
- Search for publications: searching for publications in the system
- View the results of a Search: view of the results of a publication search
- View publication details: view details of a selected publication
- View detailed information for multiple publications: detailed view of multiple publications
- Download a single publication: downloading the full text of a publication
- Download multiple publications: downloading the full text of multiple publications
- Consult publication references: consult the references cited in a publication resulting from a search done on the system
- Consult references for multiple publications: consult the references cited in all the publications resulting from a search done on the system
- Display the full text of a publication: obtain a copy of the full text of a publication resulting from a search done on the system
- View details of a reference: view details of a selected reference cited in a publication resulting from a search done on the system
- Export the references cited in a publication (BIB format): download the references cited in a publication in bib format
- Export the references cited in a publication (RIS format): download the references cited in a publication in RIS format
- View authors: view information about an author of a publication in the system
- Editing personal data: editing personal data
- Access to your own publications: access directly to your own publications
- Edit your own publications: possibility to modify information of your own publications by a Publisher
- Upload publications: add a publication to the system
- Search users: searching users in the system
- Edit user settings: Select a system user (Members, Publishers, Moderators) and change his settings
- Create User: create a new user
- Delete User: delete an existing user
- Create Group: create a new group
- Search Group: select a group from a list in order to view the group details
- Delete Group: delete an existing group in the system
- Edit group settings: Select a system group and change its settings
- Edit system configuration settings: access the configuration panel in order to change the system configuration settingshere are a total of 31 Functional Requirements listed in the SRS.